\begin{enumerate}
    \item How can the best set of features be selected for a given dataset and model, and does the method carry over from small molecules to antibodies and reactions?
    \item Does distance in a hybrid representation track the label better than distance in the best single representation, and do methods built on nearest neighbors work better in it?
    \item Can noisy labels be found and corrected, and do hybrid representations stay ahead of single representations through that correction?
    \item Does weighting features by their importance help in building hybrid representations, in model training and in finding noisy labels?
